id: difficult-time-freeze
name: Difficult Time Freeze
restriction: true
reduction: 5
locked: Improved Time Freeze
freezeOneAttack: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  One Attacking Maneuver at most during a Frozen Turn.
text: >
  Difficult Time Freeze: While not impossible, you find it difficult to affect the world around you while time is frozen.
  –Locked Advancements: Improved Time Freeze
  –TP Cost: -5
  –Effect: You can only use 1 Attacking Maneuver during a Frozen Turn.
